---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — IELTS Corner"
  description="Terms of Service for IELTS Corner tutoring, essay correction, and lessons."
  type="page"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: var(--s-6);">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--s-4);">Last updated: March 2, 2026</p>

    <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--s-4);">
      <div>
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of IELTS Corner's website and services. By accessing or using our site, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use our services.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>1. Services Offered</h2>
        <p>IELTS Corner provides:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Free lessons:</strong> Educational content for IELTS and CELPIP preparation</li>
          <li><strong>Tutoring:</strong> Live 1-on-1 lessons via Zoom (CA$30/hour)</li>
          <li><strong>Essay correction:</strong> Feedback on writing (CA$15 per essay)</li>
          <li><strong>eBook:</strong> Downloadable grammar and writing guide ($19.99 CAD)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>2. Use of Free Lessons</h2>
        <p><strong>License:</strong> We grant you a limited, non-exclusive license to view and use lessons for personal, non-commercial study only.</p>
        <p><strong>Restrictions:</strong> You may not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Reproduce or redistribute lessons without permission</li>
          <li>Use lessons for commercial purposes</li>
          <li>Modify or create derivative works</li>
          <li>Remove copyright notices or watermarks</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Violation of these restrictions may result in termination of your access.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>3. Tutoring Services</h2>
        <p><strong>How it works:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Book sessions on our website or by contacting us</li>
          <li>Pay via Stripe, PayPal, or e-transfer</li>
          <li>Lessons are delivered via Zoom</li>
          <li>Each session is 60 minutes</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Cancellation policy:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Free cancellation with 24-hour notice</li>
          <li>Cancellations within 24 hours: non-refundable</li>
          <li>No-show without notice: non-refundable</li>
          <li>Rescheduling available with 24-hour notice</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Satisfaction guarantee:</strong></p>
        <p>If you are not satisfied with your tutoring experience, you can request a full refund for your first 2 paid hours within 7 days.</p>

        <p><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> We do not guarantee a specific test score. Improvements depend on your effort, participation, and other factors beyond our control.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>4. Essay Correction Service</h2>
        <p><strong>How it works:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Submit your essay via our contact form or email</li>
          <li>Pay CA$15 per essay</li>
          <li>Receive detailed feedback within 24–48 hours</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Feedback includes:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Grammar and vocabulary corrections</li>
          <li>Organization and structure feedback</li>
          <li>Estimated IELTS/CELPIP band score</li>
          <li>Key areas to improve</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Band score estimates:</strong> Band score estimates are predictions based on our experience. Actual scores may vary depending on official test conditions.</p>

        <p><strong>Refund policy:</strong> Full refund if you're unsatisfied with quality. No refunds for estimated band scores that differ from actual test results.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>5. eBook Purchase</h2>
        <p><strong>What you get:</strong> A downloadable PDF guide covering IELTS grammar and writing strategies.</p>
        <p><strong>License:</strong> Personal, non-commercial use only. You may not resell, redistribute, or reproduce the eBook.</p>
        <p><strong>Refund policy:</strong> Full refund within 30 days of purchase. After 30 days, no refunds.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>6. Payment Terms</h2>
        <p><strong>Accepted payment methods:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Stripe (credit/debit cards: Visa, Mastercard, American Express)</li>
          <li>PayPal</li>
          <li>e-Transfer (Canada only)</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Billing:</strong> Charges appear as "IELTS Corner" on your statement.</p>
        <p><strong>Taxes:</strong> All prices quoted are before applicable Canadian taxes (GST/HST).</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p><strong>Our content:</strong> All lessons, materials, and advice on IELTS Corner are our property (or licensed from IELTS/CELPIP source materials).</p>
        <p><strong>Your submissions:</strong> When you submit essays or writing for feedback, you retain ownership. We may use anonymized examples for teaching purposes (with your permission).</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>8. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Violate any laws or regulations</li>
          <li>Post offensive, discriminatory, or inappropriate content</li>
          <li>Harass or threaten tutors or other users</li>
          <li>Attempt to hack or access our systems</li>
          <li>Share login credentials with others</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Violation may result in account suspension or termination.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>IELTS Corner is provided "as is" without warranties. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Indirect or consequential damages</li>
          <li>Lost test scores or opportunities</li>
          <li>Technical issues or service interruptions</li>
          <li>Third-party service issues (Zoom, payment processors, etc.)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by Canadian law (Ontario). Any disputes will be resolved in the courts of Ontario.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>11. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms at any time. Changes take effect immediately. Continued use of our services means you accept the updated Terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Questions about these Terms? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: kara.abdolmaleki@gmail.com</li>
          <li>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/16479317537">Message us</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr style="margin: var(--s-4) 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--text-muted-light);" />

      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
        By using IELTS Corner, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms of Service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
